# Full historical experiment mirrors are local scientific archives. Keep the
# compact registries, schemas, templates, tools, and design documents instead.
/research_archive/experiments/

# Runtime manifests bind immutable runs to specific hosts and absolute paths.
# Keep them with local provenance; publish portable examples separately.
/research/experiments/*_RUNTIME_MANIFEST.json

# Frozen result cards and raw payloads stay local because they contain
# host-bound provenance. Commit the portable research/RESULTS_SUMMARY_IGM.md.
/research/results/
